WEBVTT

00:00:06.710 --> 00:00:08.840
<i>I'm so happy.</i>

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:11.470
<i>I get to see Milady.</i>

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Milady... She's all I care about.</i>

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:22.040
<i>Little girls!</i>

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:22.790
<i>Little girls!</i>

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:23.250
<i>Little girls!</i>

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.300
<i>There're so many little girls!</i>

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:29.570
<i>But Milady is the only 
one I really care about seeing.</i>

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>Actually, shouldn't she...</i>

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.650
<b>Episode 3:  My Maid Is Sneaking Up On Me</b>

00:02:07.940 --> 00:02:09.020
Milady!

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.650
It's time for your snack.

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:14.530
<i>I'll try asking her about 
school during snack time.</i>

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:16.210
Milady!

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:17.400
Leave it there.

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.700
I made an ice cream dessert from scratch.

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:22.230
I'd like for you to eat it in the kitchen,

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:25.160
the moment I get it super 
cold out of the freezer...

00:02:25.570 --> 00:02:26.930
<i>Ice cream...</i>

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:31.830
Guess I'll have to eat it, then.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:48.600
<i>She comes down now a lot easier than before.</i>

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:52.490
<i>I think we're a lot closer now!</i>

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.860
<i>Just a little bit more, and...</i>

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:00.690
Milady, this is pudding a la mode.

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:02.450
I ordered it in from England.

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:03.240
Very good.

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:06.280
Here is your tiramisu.

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:08.150
I got this from Italy.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:08.930
Very good.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.400
Here're our marriage papers.

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.170
I got them from France.

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.090
Very good.

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:23.470
French Marriage Papers
 Wife -  Kamoi Tsubame
 Wife -  Takanashi Misha

00:03:19.850 --> 00:03:23.470
<i>Not too much longer before 
she'd sign off on marriage!</i>

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:30.730
I promise to love you,
even after your first period.

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.280
<i>That's too much!</i>

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:34.310
<i>I can't get too far ahead of myself.</i>

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:35.480
<i>I'm back to normal.</i>

00:03:35.990 --> 00:03:37.730
<i>She's acting pretty weird today, too.</i>

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:39.360
Oh, yeah...

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:42.490
Don't you have school?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.990
<i>She finally realized!</i>

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.490
I...

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:51.500
I-I...

00:03:56.160 --> 00:04:00.130
I'm Russian, so I don't have to go to school.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.370
Oh, I see!

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:14.690
You're exempt from local laws, right?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.900
<i>I'm glad she's so stupid.</i>

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.830
Takanashi-san -
 Let's take care of the
 hamsters again.

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:31.640
I'm back.

00:04:31.640 --> 00:04:32.420
Excuse me...

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.330
Is Milady not going to school?

00:04:38.520 --> 00:04:40.280
You noticed?

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.220
I did.

00:04:43.210 --> 00:04:46.510
She never really got used to it.

00:04:46.950 --> 00:04:51.520
Her Japanese is fine, so
I put her into a public school,

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:55.440
but her appearance attracts 
attention, as you might imagine.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:04:57.520
She didn't like everyone 
staring at her all the time.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:02.690
But when her mother was alive, she 
did her best to make it to school.

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.150
When she passed away...

00:05:05.850 --> 00:05:07.280
You lied, Yasuhiro!

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:10.660
I was a good girl, and 
Mommy didn't get better!

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.790
I'm not going to be a good girl anymore!

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:17.070
You could say that I'm trying 
to avoid dealing with Misha.

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:22.800
I want to let her be until her 
wounds heal from this ordeal.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.310
I see.

00:05:24.310 --> 00:05:25.520
Leave it to me.

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:26.050
Huh?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.600
I will go to school with Milady!

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:34.980
Everyone can have their eyes on me, instead!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:37.230
You'll get arrested in five minutes.

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:41.360
I'll try talking to Milady a little bit, then.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.860
Are you sure?

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:45.120
Yes!

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:48.210
We understand each other!

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.240
I mean, I guess that's fine...

00:05:50.430 --> 00:05:51.940
I'm not going to school!

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:53.240
What?

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:56.120
What does this have to do with you, anyway?

00:05:56.120 --> 00:05:57.620
You're just our maid.

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:59.630
Oh?

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:04.360
You were happy when you got 
a friend in that game, right?

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:06.630
Even though that was me.

00:06:07.620 --> 00:06:09.510
I don't want to be friends 
with anyone at school.

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:11.390
Her skin's so white!

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.260
Her hair's so smooth!

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:15.770
All they care about is how I look.

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:19.360
Well, you're so young and 
cute it's like a miracle,

00:06:19.360 --> 00:06:21.240
and you're showing up in a classroom.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.750
Everyone's gonna look.

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:24.270
I don't like that.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:27.980
My eyes are green, and my hair is blonde.

00:06:27.980 --> 00:06:31.530
That's just how I was born.

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:39.040
Say there was a normal second grade 
boy that came to your class,

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:39.040
<b>Handa Shiro</b>

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:44.010
a boy named Handa-kun, but he looked 
like a panda on the outside.

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:48.800
That would never happen, right?

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:50.380
It's just an example.

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:52.890
You'd look at Handa-kun too, right?

00:06:54.110 --> 00:06:55.140
I wouldn't,

00:06:55.140 --> 00:06:57.520
because I would understand how he feels.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:59.280
I see.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:00.270
In that case...

00:07:00.990 --> 00:07:04.020
Handa-kun is just a normal second grader.

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:07.860
And now it's lunch time.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:09.400
Everyone's eating soba.

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:13.510
Handa-kun is the only one 
who brought his own lunch.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:17.290
<i>Is he going to eat bamboo?!</i>

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.460
Handa-kun opens his lunch...

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:28.760
It was a normal salmon lunch.

00:07:29.270 --> 00:07:31.600
Handa-kun has an allergy to soba,

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:34.220
so he couldn't eat the school soba.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:36.510
I see... It was an allergy.

00:07:36.960 --> 00:07:37.760
And you looked, right?

00:07:39.600 --> 00:07:40.330
I did.

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:43.270
And that's just how it is.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:46.500
Things you've never seen before, cute things:

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.030
they attract attention.

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:49.750
<i>So pretty.</i>

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:51.060
<i>So cute.</i>

00:07:51.060 --> 00:07:53.030
It's not like you mean any harm.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.130
Milady.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:03.790
You can only judge someone by their 
appearance before you get to know them.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:07.200
It takes time for someone 
to know what you're like.

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:08.800
Time...

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:10.450
<i>I see.</i>

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:15.180
<i>I ran away before they were even 
able to tell what I was like.</i>

00:08:15.730 --> 00:08:21.250
I make sure I watch you every 
day to learn what you're like.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:22.940
Watch?

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:24.360
For example,

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:29.820
the average length of toilet paper you 
use in the bathroom is 120 centimeters.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:31.440
What?!

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:33.580
How do you know that?!

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:34.700
That's easy.

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:37.700
I prepare a roll of toilet paper that 
doesn't have much left of the roll.

00:08:38.070 --> 00:08:40.950
Then I install that roll the second floor 
restroom of the Takanashi household.

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:08.270
<b>September 4th, 7:15 85 cm
5th, 6:30 82 cm
 6th, 7:18 78 cm
 7th, 7:00 80 cm
8th, 7:15 120 cm 
9th, 6:47 125 cm
10th, 7:30 115 cm</b>

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:04.140
Then I just subtract the remaining 
amount of toilet paper

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:06.370
on the roll to get the amount used 
after you leave the restroom.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:08.270
From there it's simple 
to calculate the average.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:11.400
Of course I re-wrap the 
toilet paper every time.

00:09:11.620 --> 00:09:12.660
What a second...

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:15.780
You dressed up like a ninja 
and broke in every night?!

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:18.140
I'm just kidding.

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:20.660
I can do all of that during work hours.

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:24.170
Why are you doing that?

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:30.170
Isn't it normal to want to know 
more about the person you like?

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.170
So gross...

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:33.920
<i>Gross...</i>

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:36.920
I don't watch you while you're 
in the restroom, though.

00:09:36.920 --> 00:09:38.430
Of course you shouldn't!

00:09:38.780 --> 00:09:41.810
And how would you even learn more 
about me through toilet paper?!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:47.810
<b>Toilet Defense White Paper</b>

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:47.810
The average usage of toilet 
paper in Japan is 80 cm.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:51.840
And you're 40 cm over that.

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:58.860
Could it be that because I told you that 
you should wipe better the other day,

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:01.740
you're actually doing what I said?

00:10:02.070 --> 00:10:05.000
And doesn't that make you super cute?!

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:12.090
Also you chew a different amount of times 
for the things you like and don't like!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:15.040
You make sure you chew the things you like 
well, and the things you don't like you gulp down.

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:16.320
It's how cute and childish you are.

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:19.120
And then it's cute how earnest you are 
that you don't leave any leftovers.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:21.440
Also, it's cute how carefully and 
well you use your chopsticks,

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:22.600
even though your personality wouldn't 
have you think you'd be like that.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.870
You naturally smile when 
you play with Kumagoro-sama,

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:28.220
and that tells me just how much 
of a nice girl you really are.

00:10:28.220 --> 00:10:30.120
And your toenails are 
even super well shaped.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.050
Makes me think about how perfect you are.

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:33.480
Also, also...

00:10:33.820 --> 00:10:34.610
I-I'll...

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.230
...go to school.

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:37.330
Huh?

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:39.610
I'll go to school!

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:42.120
Really?

00:10:43.420 --> 00:10:47.600
<i>She understands my feelings!</i>

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:50.620
<i>You could call this love!</i>

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:55.290
<i>I'd rather be at school then have 
this annoying and disgusting person</i>

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.380
<i>hang all over me all day.</i>

00:10:57.560 --> 00:10:59.440
Oh, yeah.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.360
This is a print out from school.

00:11:01.360 --> 00:11:03.890
It seems someone brought it by.

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:10.390
I wonder if it was the person who was 
assigned to taking care of the hamsters with me.

00:11:10.640 --> 00:11:13.360
<b>Alligator</b>

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:12.740
I think it was something that 
sounded like alligator...

00:11:13.240 --> 00:11:15.080
...or armpits...

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:18.900
<b>Armpits</b>

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:19.340
She didn't really stand out 
much, so I can't remember.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:20.400
<b>Hey!</b>

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:23.410
I guess I'll figure it out if I go tomorrow.

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.400
I'm...

00:11:26.400 --> 00:11:28.240
a little excited.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:33.630
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:38.000
<b>Uzamaid!</b>

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:43.430
<i>I'm going to school now.</i>

00:11:43.770 --> 00:11:47.810
<i>That woman will have full 
control over the house.</i>

00:11:48.160 --> 00:11:51.060
<i>However, this is not a defeat.</i>

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:55.520
<i>It's time for me to build up my power!</i>

00:11:56.300 --> 00:11:57.800
Listen up, Kumagoro.

00:11:57.800 --> 00:11:59.650
You protect this room.

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:03.450
You can do it, Misha.

00:12:09.820 --> 00:12:13.210
Misha-chan, good morning.

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:17.280
Let's go to school together!

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:18.710
Why are you dressed like that?!

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:22.130
I think if I tell them I got sick and
stopped going to school for three years,

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:25.970
and now I'm in the 6th grade at 
15, I'll be able to pull it off.

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:31.430
No one who was sick is 
going to be this ripped!

00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:32.700
Fifteen...

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:35.440
I can go to school just fine!

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:38.620
Don't follow me!

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:41.700
Okay, Milady...

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:43.320
Fifteen?

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:45.820
<i>I can go by myself.</i>

00:12:46.380 --> 00:12:48.700
<i>I feel better without her around.</i>

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.200
Hasn't it been a while since she was around?

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.990
She's cute.

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:55.850
<i>I'm fine.</i>

00:12:56.900 --> 00:12:58.820
Takanashi-san!

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:02.400
<i>It's the girl who helped with the hamsters.</i>

00:13:02.400 --> 00:13:05.160
<i>She brought the printout...</i>

00:13:05.160 --> 00:13:06.800
<i>I can't remember her name.</i>

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:08.370
Good morning.

00:13:08.370 --> 00:13:10.080
G-Good morning.

00:13:10.080 --> 00:13:12.610
<i>I'll take a look at her notebook 
or something for her name later.</i>

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:14.500
You're not sick anymore!

00:13:14.500 --> 00:13:15.230
Huh?

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:19.200
<i>Oh, yeah. I guess everyone 
thinks I was out sick.</i>

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:21.180
Yeah, I'm fine now.

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:22.400
I see!

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:26.290
Let's go!

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:27.710
Um...

00:13:29.060 --> 00:13:31.410
Thanks for the message and the printout.

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:35.120
We can take care of the 
hamsters together again!

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:35.910
I'm happy!

00:13:37.300 --> 00:13:39.520
So how are the hamsters doing?

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:44.760
Y-Yeah, super good...

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:45.670
Huh?

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.130
There's more of them.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:58.960
There was only one of them 
per cage last time, right?

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.360
Yeah, but...

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:02.860
<b>End of first semester</b>

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:07.770
<i>Please take care of them during summer break.</i>

00:14:07.770 --> 00:14:08.800
<i>I will!</i>

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.070
<i>There won't be any kids around,</i>

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:21.630
<i>so I'm sure you two will 
be lonely by yourselves.</i>

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:28.220
<i>They get along well, and I'll 
only have to clean one cage.</i>

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:29.720
<i>Two birds with one stone!</i>

00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:40.330
<i>The babies are cute!</i>

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.140
<i>They had more kids!</i>

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.160
So that's what happened...

00:14:56.490 --> 00:14:58.340
How dumb can that teacher be?!

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:00.370
You can't say that...

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.670
Takanashi-san?

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:04.450
It's been a while.

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:05.840
You're doing okay now!

00:15:11.340 --> 00:15:13.850
<b>I love safety</b>

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:23.230
This room is...

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:27.360
That room is very important to my daughter.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:31.870
It's most likely her now
deceased mother's room.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:36.290
In other words, the room for the person 
who will be my future mother-in-law.

00:15:38.640 --> 00:15:41.070
I want to see what's in here,

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.110
and I also wonder if it's being properly cleaned.

00:15:43.110 --> 00:15:46.220
I'll be true to Milady's
feelings for right now.

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:48.760
And someday...

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:52.010
Milady.

00:15:52.440 --> 00:15:53.520
Tsubame.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:03.810
Let's go.

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.110
Milady!

00:16:09.640 --> 00:16:11.040
Mommy!

00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:13.930
There's someone I want you to meet!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:19.740
There will be a day when
Milady opens this door for me.

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:21.340
I'm sure there will!

00:16:22.320 --> 00:16:25.250
In any event, we're done cleaning now.

00:16:25.250 --> 00:16:27.710
<b>Going back to school celebration!</b>

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:28.280
And just take a look at this.

00:16:28.280 --> 00:16:29.570
I'm so good at this.

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:31.010
<b>Going to school</b>

00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:33.500
I got everything ready 
for her going back party.

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:40.940
I don't have anything to do 
until Milady gets back.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:44.020
She told me not to follow her, but...

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.900
She didn't say not to go after her.

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:13.170
That worked.

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:15.620
There's a guard at the front gate.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:20.060
There're cameras around the school, as well.

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:21.720
But the skies are safe.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:30.480
And I have my grade school (15 years old) 
cosplay all ready to go, just in case.

00:17:30.760 --> 00:17:31.610
And now...

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:36.060
This isn't put together too well...

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:44.870
I'll come back and fix it later.

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:49.750
<i>I'm in grade school right now!</i>

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:53.540
<i>Just strolling in here is the 
best way not to get caught!</i>

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:55.090
She's huge!

00:17:58.220 --> 00:17:59.960
Second year, class two.

00:17:59.960 --> 00:18:01.100
This is it.

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:05.730
<i>Milady!</i>

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:08.980
<b>Emergency Class Meeting
 Too many hamsters</b>

00:18:06.220 --> 00:18:08.980
We're going to have an 
emergency class meeting.

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:12.110
We're here to talk about the 
massive increase in hamsters.

00:18:12.440 --> 00:18:14.680
You weren't even here until today.

00:18:14.680 --> 00:18:16.240
Why are you in charge?

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.490
Quiet!

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:22.340
I learned what I needed to when 
I was put in charge of the pets.

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:25.160
I the know most about
the hamsters in this class.

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:28.920
Also, the hamsters lives are in danger.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:30.920
Are the hamsters going to die?

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:35.120
The mother has had a lot of 
children and is exhausted.

00:18:35.120 --> 00:18:37.700
If we stress out the mother any further,

00:18:37.700 --> 00:18:40.550
she'll become sick and eat the children.

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:42.180
What?!

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:44.870
Hamsters eat their own...

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:46.310
Wh-What should we do?

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:50.410
First, we'll move the mother to a quiet room

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:53.650
and give her nutrients so that 
she can raise her children.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:58.070
And then we'll separate her from the 
father so that more children aren't born.

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:02.610
We've separated the children 
out into different cages

00:19:02.610 --> 00:19:05.140
before more of them can reproduce.

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:10.860
When they get a bit bigger, we'll 
find families to give them away to.

00:19:11.630 --> 00:19:12.960
I want one.

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:14.960
If I can get one for free, I'll take it.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.840
It's not that easy!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:22.090
<b>How to take care of your hamster</b>

00:19:17.660 --> 00:19:21.260
You need to study, and talk 
to your family at home.

00:19:22.730 --> 00:19:26.850
If you don't pay attention 
and they die, it's very sad.

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:32.730
We've created a printout showing how to 
take care of them and what you'll need.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:35.550
We helped, too.

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:36.230
Yeah.

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:39.810
Please help!

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:41.960
And...

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:44.680
Honey!

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:45.740
Dear!

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:49.120
We moved the male hamsters to one cage.

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:51.200
During lunch, we researched on the internet

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:54.600
and in the library on how
 to take care of hamsters.

00:19:54.600 --> 00:19:56.630
Then we all made this printout.

00:19:56.920 --> 00:20:00.800
Takanashi-san was really cool 
the way she led everyone.

00:20:01.970 --> 00:20:05.050
We thought she was a quiet 
girl, but she's really cool.

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:10.210
I was just worried about the hamsters...

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:14.060
<i>This is the first time they've seen 
something other than my appearance.</i>

00:20:14.990 --> 00:20:18.810
You can only judge someone by their 
appearance before you get to know them.

00:20:19.310 --> 00:20:22.070
It takes time for someone 
to know what you're like.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:24.360
<i>She was right.</i>

00:20:24.990 --> 00:20:27.080
<i>Not that I like her.</i>

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:34.010
Milady, you've done wonderfully!

00:20:42.390 --> 00:20:44.080
Thank you for today...

00:20:44.080 --> 00:20:44.840
Um...

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:46.440
<i>Alligator?</i>

00:20:46.440 --> 00:20:47.260
<i>Armpits?</i>

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:49.390
Oh, you can use this.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:52.520
I have notes from when you were out.

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:54.970
Th-Thank you.

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:57.520
Washizaki Mimika

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:58.800
I'll remember it now!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:07.280
<i>I'll ask Yasuhiro if we can get a hamster.</i>

00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:09.490
I'm back.

00:21:09.490 --> 00:21:11.290
Oh, Yasuhiro's shoes.

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:14.510
Kumagoro!

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:18.810
Yasuhiro, are you done with work...

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:20.800
What's going on with this room?!

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:26.020
Yes, she is our maid...

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:27.720
Yes.

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:30.970
Yes. Sorry about that...

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:33.450
I'll tell her to be careful in the future.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:37.080
What's wrong, Yasuhiro?

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:39.080
What's up with this room?

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:43.320
The maid said she wanted to throw you 
a surprise "going back to school" party.

00:21:43.320 --> 00:21:45.950
I don't need a surprise party like that!

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:51.080
I heard she kind of snuck into 
your school and got caught.

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:54.610
What a terrible person...

00:21:58.000 --> 00:21:59.030
I'm sorry.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:00.230
I'm sorry.

00:22:00.370 --> 00:22:01.030
I'm sorry.

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:02.190
I'm sorry.

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:08.220
I'm sorry!
